1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,270
Let a stranger into

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,270
your computer?

3
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,590
Do these three things

4
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,390
now.

5
00:00:04,736 --> 00:00:05,546
If you let someone

6
00:00:05,496 --> 00:00:06,746
get remote access,

7
00:00:06,696 --> 00:00:08,346
or you clicked something

8
00:00:08,296 --> 00:00:09,286
that may have installed

9
00:00:09,236 --> 00:00:11,066
software you didn't want,

10
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:12,986
the FTC suggests three

11
00:00:12,936 --> 00:00:13,906
steps.

12
00:00:14,356 --> 00:00:15,766
Update your security software,

13
00:00:15,716 --> 00:00:16,926
or if you don't

14
00:00:16,876 --> 00:00:18,506
have any, download one

15
00:00:18,456 --> 00:00:19,806
recommended by independent

16
00:00:19,756 --> 00:00:21,566
review sites, friends or

17
00:00:21,516 --> 00:00:22,366
family.

18
00:00:22,576 --> 00:00:23,646
Run a scan and

19
00:00:23,596 --> 00:00:25,506
delete anything it flags.

20
00:00:25,736 --> 00:00:27,486
Then change your passwords

21
00:00:27,436 --> 00:00:28,966
and turn on two-factor

22
00:00:28,916 --> 00:00:30,026
authentication.

